1c:T8d9,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"番茄云(TomatoCloud)怎么样?值得买吗?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"2018 年老牌机场,多协议、三网入口、中转+IPLC 专线、有游戏加速节点、解锁 Netflix,多家评测一致认为主动跑路概率极低,第三方监测近期零投诉。要老牌稳定的用户值得从 $4/月最低档月付试。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"番茄云跑路了吗?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"截至 2026 年 7 月核实:未跑路。不在跑路机场名单,官网正常访问,第三方监测显示运营正常、近期零投诉。节点超时多为 GFW 污染订阅或换了订阅服务器,去官网重取最新订阅即可。但即便老牌也只建议月付。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"番茄云有优惠码吗?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"优惠码以官网公告和官方 TG 为准,节假日常有活动。警惕第三方站的假优惠码和形近仿冒域名,输账号付款前认准官方渠道。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"番茄云为什么是美元计价?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"它按美元定价($4/月起),属于海外实体运营机场的常见做法,支付时折算成人民币结算,实际支付金额与可用支付方式以官网支付页显示为准。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"番茄云能打游戏吗?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"它有专门的游戏加速节点,这是不少机场没有的特色。但实际延迟表现取决于你本地网络到目标游戏服务器的情况,建议月付实测。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"番茄云能下载 BT 吗?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"不建议。它使用国内中转、有审计,屏蔽 BT 下载、极端政治、金融诈骗及 360 等软件。BT 需求请选无审计的直连/海外方案。"}},{"@type":"Question","name":"番茄云节点连不上怎么办?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"单节点超时先切换其他节点;大面积超时先检查本地网络,再去官网重新获取订阅链接(GFW 常污染订阅);官网打不开则先翻墙再访问,或通过官方渠道获取最新域名。建议客户端设置订阅定时更新。"}}]}12:["$","$1","c",{"children":[["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-12","children":["$L18","$L19","$L1a","$L1b",["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-2","children":[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1c"}}],["$","blockquote",null,{"className":"my-6 border-l-2 border-accent bg-card py-3 pr-3 pl-4 font-serif text-lg leading-8 text-foreground/85 not-italic","children":["\n",["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"30 秒结论"}]}],["$","$1","1",{"children":":番茄云(TomatoCloud)是一家 "}],["$","$1","2",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"2018 年成立的老牌机场"}]}],["$","$1","3",{"children":["(运营 8 年,这个资历在机场圈算「活得久」的一档),支持 ",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/shadowsocks","className":"text-accent hover:underline","children":"Shadowsocks"}],["/SSR/Vmess/",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/trojan","className":"text-accent hover:underline","children":"Trojan"}]," "]]}],["$","$1","4",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"多协议"}]}],["$","$1","5",{"children":",国内"}],["$","$1","6",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"电信/联通/移动三网入口"}]}],["$","$1","7",{"children":",线路是"}],["$","$1","8",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"公网中转 + IPLC 专线"}]}],["$","$1","9",{"children":"组合(专线不过 GFW,敏感期稳定性有保证),还有"}],["$","$1","10",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"专门的游戏加速节点"}]}],["$","$1","11",{"children":"(特色)。解锁 Netflix/Disney+,多家评测一致评价「老牌、技术扎实、"}],["$","$1","12",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"主动跑路概率极低"}]}],["$","$1","13",{"children":"」,第三方监测显示运营正常、近期零投诉。一个小特点:"}],["$","$1","14",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"它按美元计价"}]}],["$","$1","15",{"children":"($4/月/98G 起,支付时折算人民币结算)。结论:"}],["$","$1","16",{"children":["$","strong",null,{"className":"font-semibold text-foreground","children":"要多协议 + 三网友好 + 专线 + 游戏节点的老牌机场,番茄云值得月付一试"}]}],["$","$1","17",{"children":"。"}]]}],"\n"]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leading-8 text-foreground/85","children":["$","em",null,{"className":"text-[0.95em] text-muted not-italic","children":"正常运营、老牌、跑路风险极低;建议月付"}]}],["$","hr",null,{"className":"my-10 border-rule"}],["$L1d",["$","h2",null,{"id":"番茄云跑路了吗","className":"mt-12 mb-4 scroll-mt-28 border-b border-rule pb-2 font-serif text-2xl font-semibold tracking-tight lg:scroll-mt-20","children":"番茄云跑路了吗?"}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"my-5 leadi